@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Index";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_UserSideLayout.cshtml";
}
<div class="container p-5" style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; margin-top:30px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Email Troubleshooting – Smooth, Reliable Communication</h1>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                There is no doubt that emailing is a necessity for everyone in any given setting. Nonetheless, it can become rather annoying when there are factors hindering one from sending or receiving emails or logging into one’s account. TechValet ensures that issues related to emails do not interfere with the day-to-day activities of its clients.
            </p>
            <br />
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Common Email Issues We Solve:</h2>
            <ul style="font-size: 18px; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you facing challenges in sending or receiving emails? This could either be caused by issues with the network connection or wrong account configurations.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Have you misplaced your password? There is no alarm, better yet, we can help you reset the password. Your password will be reset without further troubling you.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do you have worries about receiving unwanted communication or scams? We fortify your account's security even more.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you facing any difficulties in syncing emails on your devices? We can tackle all concerns related to functionality, including compatibility and syncing.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do you find it hard to create a new account? We will ensure you are established and ready.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">How TechValet Helps You:</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                From a complete installation all the way to diagnosing a fault, we will ensure that all your email accounts work efficiently on every gadget or device.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Call to Action Section -->
<div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding:20px">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Let TechValet optimize the functioning of your email. Fix My Email Problems Now.</h3>
    <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #555;">Call TechValet Computer Support for fast and reliable service.</p>
    <a href="@Url.Action("Contact","Home")" style="background-color: #E48F01; color: #fff; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 18px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 20px; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#E48F01'">
        Call Us Now
    </a>
</div>

<!-- Additional Footer Text -->
<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #777;">
        At TechValet, we’re committed to making technology accessible and stress-free for everyone. Reach out today and experience the joy of simplified tech!
    </p>
</div>
